<p>Your Rethread now braids the lifelines of all targets it hits for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.  Braided targets take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46%</acronym> of all damage dealt to other braided targets.</p><p>The amount of damage shared will scale with your Spellpower.</p>